direction: right
old: Original committed archival bytes
registry: Existing publication identity and per-origin Git sources
borrow: Exact byte borrow
verify: Commit + blob + SHA + byte count
review: Existing archive / causal / environment consumers
policy: Real sealed ASCENT conditional policy
run: Actual runtime result still required
refuse: Missing object / summary only / drift refused
pending: Full framework and hosted macOS remain open
old -> registry: symbolic identity only
registry -> borrow
borrow -> verify
verify -> review: memory only; no transcript file
review -> policy: original budgets and failures retained
policy -> run: eligibility is not execution
verify -> refuse: invalid or unknown
run -> pending: independent product gates
